- `catalogue_items`: 143 objects in catalogue order: `item_id`, `kind`, `category_ids` (the catalogue's ids), `sub_setting_ids` (all of the item's, in order), `sample_rows` (the M-ids of the rows whose `vendor_items` name it, sorted), `sub_settings_named` (list of `{sub_setting_id, rows}` for the sub-settings a row names), `map_controls` (the control ids of the map entries that name the item), `duplicate_name_peers` (the other item id carrying its name, or empty), `flags` (`NO_SAMPLE_ROW` when `sample_rows` is empty, `DUPLICATE_NAME_TWIN` when peers is non-empty).
